B.Z4=new A.bB("Create products (the software you sell) and use cases (the pains and outcomes that matter). Tag them onto people.\n\nWhen a use case is linked to a product, the person card shows them on one row: product on the left, use case on the right. Unlinked tags get their own line. Detail view lists every tag \u2014 nothing is hidden behind a +N chip.\n\nProducts can live on one chart or in a device-wide catalog (home screen \u2192 More \u2192 Products) so the same product appears in every org you map.",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
B.a0I=new A.fz(B.pA,"Products and use cases",B.Z4,null)
B.IG=new A.cp(61563,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.Z6=new A.bB("Orgora Charts maps people, reporting lines, products, and use cases. There is no Orgora account. Charts stay on this device unless you save one to your own Google Drive or OneDrive.\n\nHome is your list of orgs. Search is in the bar. The \xb7\xb7\xb7 menu holds Import from LinkedIn, Products (software you sell), Inboxes, and this Help. Tap New org chart under the last chart, on the right, when you are ready to map a real organization.\n\nOpen the sample chart to look around first. The sample does not count toward the free-tier chart limit.",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
B.a0J=new A.fz(B.IG,"Getting started",B.Z6,null)
B.IA=new A.cp(58189,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.Z5=new A.bB("Open a chart, then Share (not the home \xb7\xb7\xb7 menu). Send a PDF picture, or an Orgora file the other person opens in Orgora Charts.\n\nViewing a shared chart is free. Creating a new chart from one still follows the free-tier size limits unless you are Pro.",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
B.a0K=new A.fz(B.IA,"Sharing a chart",B.Z5,null)
B.IF=new A.cp(61284,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.YW=new A.bB("Backup and sync is in the home menu. The switch starts off, so nothing uploads until you turn it on. Then pick Google Drive or OneDrive and tap Done. Each chart is one Orgora file in that account. The file is not Pro and not a public link. There is no Orgora server.",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
B.a0L=new A.fz(B.IF,"Save a chart",B.YW,null)
B.IM=new A.cp(984278,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.YN=new A.bB("Orgora Clipper copies a LinkedIn profile into the app. Nothing is sent to us. After you clip, a banner lists people waiting, or open More \u2192 Import from LinkedIn.",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
B.EM=new A.Nm(null)
B.LW=s([B.YN,B.fH,B.EM],t.p)
B.G6=new A.AH(B.ak,B.z,B.V,B.ar,null,B.cw,null,0,B.LW,null)
B.a0M=new A.fz(B.IM,"Import from LinkedIn",B.G6,null)
B.IB=new A.cp(58289,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.Za=new A.bB("Charts live on this device (and in your usual device backups). You can also save a chart to your own Google Drive or OneDrive \u2014 Orgora never hosts the file, and it is not offered as a public link. There is no Orgora account, no analytics, and no tracking. Optional email and LinkedIn clipping talk only to your provider or stay on-device.\n\nPrivacy policy: https://sdkaihub.com/orgora-charts/privacy.html",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
B.a0N=new A.fz(B.IB,"Privacy",B.Za,null)
B.IO=new A.cp(984598,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.YV=new A.bB("Grok, Claude, and GPT are labeled Beta. Beta does not mean the marketplace listing is approved. None of those listings are approved.",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
B.a0O=new A.fz(B.IO,"Connectors",B.YV,null)
B.IK=new A.cp(62072,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.YP=new A.bB("Add someone from the chart, import contacts from a connected mailbox, or import a LinkedIn profile (More \u2192 Import from LinkedIn).\n\nFind people in your inbox (home screen) scans your own mail for work addresses and suggests a chart per domain. Personal mail domains are grouped separately and are never suggested as a company chart.\n\nInbox imports land in a list on the left, not on the tree. Drag someone onto a person to make them a report, or onto empty canvas for a top-level seat. Anyone you leave in the list stays off the hierarchy.\n\nLong-press a card to drag that person under a new manager.",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
B.a0P=new A.fz(B.IK,"People",B.YP,null)
B.YU=new A.bB("Optional. From home, More \u2192 Inboxes. Sign in with Microsoft, or connect Gmail with an app password. Other providers (iCloud, Yahoo, IMAP) sit under Advanced. You can connect more than one inbox; adding Gmail does not replace Microsoft, and the reverse.\n\nCredentials stay in the device keychain; mail is read directly from your provider. Turn scanning off at any time. Disconnecting removes that account from this device.",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
B.a0Q=new A.fz(B.hZ,"Connect email",B.YU,null)
B.YQ=new A.bB("Each chart is its own org. Search by name or website, star favorites, and tap New org chart under the list.\n\nBackup and sync is in the home menu and starts off. Turn it on, pick Google Drive or OneDrive, then Done. Share a chart from inside it \u2014 not from home. You can send a PDF, or an Orgora file the other person opens in the app.\n\nInside a chart: tap a person to edit them, drag to change who reports to whom, and use the view-mode control to switch between compact titles and full detail.",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
B.a0R=new A.fz(B.lb,"Charts",B.YQ,null)
